## Homelab Context

- This is an infrastructure-as-code repository for Docker-based services running across Proxmox VMs and LXC containers.
- The authoritative repository is `/srv/homelab` on the mgmt host.
- All Ansible playbooks, inventory, roles, templates, and group variables live under `/srv/homelab/ansible`.
