- SWAG provides separate internal and external reverse proxies. DNS is managed through pfSense, Homepage aggregates services, and Proxmox hosts the compute estate.
- Use the SSH terminal only through the configured mgmt connection. Do not create direct SSH routes from the Hermes host to other hosts. Any onward host access originates from mgmt using the existing `virtuajimmy` identity and repository conventions.

